    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> be the plane, passing through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and perpendicular to the line joining the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>So, direction ratio of Plane Normal will&nbsp;be,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, equation of Plane will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, perpendicular&nbsp;distance of plane from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p>Distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
